<article class="section narrow policy"><p class="eyebrow">ARCHON PUBLISHING HOUSE</p><h1><?=Security::e($title)?></h1><p class="lead">This development policy page is a clear placeholder for final counsel-approved text.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We handle customer data and digital purchases with care. We collect only information required to provide our services, fulfil orders, respond to enquiries and meet legal obligations.</p><h2>Digital products</h2><p>Digital eBooks are provided only to customers with a completed payment. Download links are time-limited and tied to the purchasing account. Please retain a secure personal backup after download.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about this policy, contact Archon Publishing House through our contact page.</p></article>
